{"reviews":[{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-0","r":3.0,"t":"Received with a defective pump.","x":"Although the product itself has a nice scent, it's very frustrating to have to remove the defective pump to be able to use.  I sent a message to the seller and never received a response.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-1","r":5.0,"t":"Scent","x":"I love it!!!  The scent is wonderful and long lasting. The lather is so nice and soft on the skin. Could be a little longer scent but overall, I love it!!!!!!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love it and smells divine!","x":"This is so soft to the skin and smells divine. Very soft scent, yet elegant. Love it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-3","r":4.0,"t":"Exceptional fragrance for consumers who like airy florals!","x":"The Bouquet Garni Fragranced Body Shower gel\u2019s most prominent characteristic is its scent.  It definitely has the airy, ethereal fragrance of a delicate powder, leaving a pleasant and gentle scent wafting after washing\u2014no additional cologne or perfume needed Though it takes between (an estimated) 1-2 tablespoons of the gel to get sufficient lathering action, once it does, it cleans well and does result in that wonderful fragrance post showering.  One claim from the promo text I do somewhat quest","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-4","r":5.0,"t":"soft skin & great smell","x":"I purchased Rose Garden and was really excited for this because I love the smell of roses. It did not disappoint! Smells amaziiiing, definitely getting that sweet Bulgarian rose scent, and not too powdery or \u2018old\u2019 smelling. Also lathered well on a pouf, rinsed clean, & left my skin feeling silky soft. Highly recommend giving it a try if you\u2019re on the fence!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-5","r":4.0,"t":"lathers well","x":"[[VIDEOID:5a1f001511c47e51512c7544aeef60f4]] if you like a musky scent, then this soap is for you. it lathers well (see video) and has a somewhat strong musk scent; not overly strong, but definitely not light. did not dry out my skin. packaged well in a box; pump has a safety guard that doesn't allow the pump to be pressed until it's removed.","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-6","r":5.0,"t":"I love it!","x":"Just like the lotion, this is a great product. The smell lingers on your skin, and leaves your skin soft. I also use the matching lotion, and the smell is great. Its powdery, but it has a floral note to it, so you don't just smell like a big baby walking around. :) I love this.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-7","r":4.0,"t":"Love the scent. The soap is fine","x":"I love the floral scent. It stays on the body for a while. Not too pungent. The soap itself is fine. It lathers up on my luffa and I can wash my whole body with a few pumps. Not really a clean and moisturized feeling afterwards.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-8","r":3.0,"t":"Nice scent but not musky","x":"I know a few people had said the musk scents smell far more floral than like musk and I would have to agree. It\u2019s a very floral fragrance and doesn\u2019t even smell of vanilla even . It\u2019s not awful but not what I was hoping for.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-9","r":3.0,"t":"Very lightly scented.","x":"This product is SO lightly scented that it nearly smells like nothing. The little scent that is there did not last on my skin past drying off out of the shower.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-10","r":3.0,"t":"Can't  open the  pump!","x":"I LOVE the scent, but have to unscrew the top every time in the shower.  Can't get the pump to work.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great fragrance!","x":"This smells so good and is a great quality shower gel.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-12","r":3.0,"t":"Smells Good But Caused Irritation \ud83d\ude41","x":"I was so excited to try this \"Bouquet Garni Body / Shower Wash\".  The presentation is so nice & makes the product seem so high end.  The body wash arrives in its own logo cardboard box. Suitable for gift giving.  The bottle itself is a pump bottle, with a beautiful label and Silver colored accent on the pump. It really is pretty.  The actual body wash is Clear in color & smells like Vanilla overall with a tiny hint of a musky smell.  I found that the body wash does lather up really well and does","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-13","r":2.0,"t":"Overall Disappointment","x":"This product makes a rich and thick lather, but I was very disappointed in it and would not buy again, nor would I recommend it to anyone.  It DOES NOT have a noticeable MUSK fragrance.  It doesn't really smell unpleasant, but it does not smell like WHITE MUSK as it should.  :(","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-14","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste money","x":"I bought this in the Cherry Blossom scent after reading a review that raved about it and the scent. You are better off using this as hand wash. The scent is basically non existent and it dries out your skin. Save your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-15","r":5.0,"t":"I love it!","x":"I purchased this soap as a hand wash instead of a body wash.  It arrived on time and I absolutely love the sent and moisturizer in it.  I highly recommend giving this soap product a try.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-16","r":5.0,"t":"The scent is very good.","x":"The scent is very good.  The powdery scent is not dark and has a subtle scent.  It moisturizes well and the price is great.  After all, I like Korean products.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-17","r":5.0,"t":"Heavenly","x":"This stuff smells so refreshing, a true tart grapefruit scent. I look fwd to my showers and love the way my skin feels and smells after","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-18","r":5.0,"t":"Love this scent!","x":"I love this scent. Smells like a musky amber vanilla. Very sensual. It makes my bathroom smell wonderful. Very hydrating as well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-19","r":2.0,"t":"Scent is off","x":"Scent doesn\u2019t smell like vanilla or musk and is not particularly great.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great scent","x":"Love the baby powder scent and it lingers for a little while","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-21","r":5.0,"t":"Loved the Smell","x":"It was a gift for my daughter and she loved it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-22","r":1.0,"t":"Does not smell anything like described","x":"Not moisturizing at all. Fragrance not good","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-23","r":5.0,"t":"My new favorite body wash.","x":"Fantastic aroma. Lasts for several hours.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B08YJV9YL2-24","r":4.0,"t":"nice bottle of shower gel for guest bathroom","x":"I know scents are a personal thing and can be a hit or miss for most people. I didn\u2019t mind the vanilla musk scent at all and thought it was pleasant. This is a good sized bottle and should last quite a while. For anyone who does not want to use this as a shower gel you can always use it as hand soap or as a refill for your hand soap. I already have plenty of shower gels I need to use up in my own shower so I am putting this in our guest bathroom, especially since the bottle has a nice floral des","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Most reviewers love the scent, describing it as pleasant, floral, and long-lasting.","cites":[2,3,4,5,7,8,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the scent is too light, faint, or not the musk/vanilla they expected.","cites":[9,10,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers praise the soft lather and how it leaves skin feeling soft and silky.","cites":[2,3,5,6,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers had problems with the pump not working or being hard to open.","cites":[1,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention skin irritation or dryness after use.","cites":[13,15]}]},"qa":[]}